// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Safe rule evaluator
//
// NOTE: docs/RULES_ENGINE.md proposes using `Function(...)`/`eval` on the
// caller-supplied `rule` string. That is a remote code execution (RCE)
// vulnerability — any client could run arbitrary code on the server. We do
// NOT use that approach. Instead we parse the expression into an AST and
// interpret a restricted, side-effect-free grammar:
//
//   - context field access:  ctx.amount, ctx.user.role
//   - literals:               numbers, strings, true/false/null
//   - comparison:             == != === !== > >= < <=
